==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] is able to beat up the Elder Sloth, and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can deal with the Sleipnir. For the Symbiote, lure it to your base and let it hit the base, while using [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to kill the Symbiote. If your base health is low, run Base Health combos.

